		{"id":"a86cf5760688d096","type":"text","text":"<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OSYmTw6_bjc?si=bzEaeX2nW1Q8uWAE\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe>","x":-1680,"y":-3049,"width":600,"height":379},
		{"id":"f76697419cd567c3","type":"text","text":"lowk tho it would make sense for the game to take a set amount of time (maybe like 3-4 months?). Don't let the game end too early.","x":140,"y":-1300,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"69f060b4811af31d","type":"text","text":"ik this is a trans allegory but the idea of killing your siblings is also still true for the Hiue sibs","x":-1160,"y":-3140,"width":250,"height":140},
		{"id":"ca026a6c5d65d409","type":"text","text":"# Game Beats brainstorming\n---\n### Beginning:\n--- \n* Game starts in a Rakugo Hall. Shinigami kun is telling the story, as a jellyfish. Disclaimer that everyone is a jellyfish before he becomes his Gijinka form.\n\t* Do a Rakugo bit before bowing and moving onto the next scene\n\t\n* (March 31st) Meet Shinki, a jellyfish girl recently kicked out of her house for being framed for embezzlement. She's at her lowest point, but the closer she's pushed to death the more determined she is to make money\n* Meet Shinigami kun, who wants to torment her but is fascinated by her business proposal, and agrees. Possesses Shinki.\n\n* Start quack doctor scheme (Shinki: \"If it works, is it really a scam?\")\n\t* Tutorial for quack doctor scheme. Will be used in the management sim aspect\n\t* You go into the house, see the patient in their futon. \n\t* Shinigami kun will be at the foot of the bed (ik it might not be accurate to the story but for game reasons I really want it to work like this.)\n\n### Management Sim part\n--- \n* Rounds span a week. Each round has x turns.\n    *  General Round things:\n    \t* Beginning of Round: Advertise, Customize office, Go Shopping\n\t    \t* *(Allow player to choose prices after the first round?)*\n\t\t    \t* Or even better, allow players to choose what kind of fees to tack on (each fee lowers the chance of success)\n        \t* Certain items make the game easier, boost your chances of feet shinigami, or are just requests from Shinigami kun\n\t        \t* Money Omamori: 500 yen\n        * Middle of Round: Go to different places, heal or refuse.\n        * End of Round: Hang out with Shinigami kun (Affection meter maybe? Or satisfaction meter ig. This is required or else he will leave. Maybe). Some events require money\n        * You can only choose up to 5 clients per round. You can choose them from a pool of 10 though\n\t        * Maybe there's an item that lets you choose up to 7 per round? (or maybe that's just the advertising)\n    * Nozaki Family are a forced event and will come depending on your money threshold during a round, or will come when you buy a certain item\n\t    * OR, maybe they'll just show up on your list in the 4th week and you can just completely skip them if you want. But maybe they'll pay like, a lot of money or they'll offer the player something super valuable in return\n\t\t    * Or maybe Shinki will mention that they own a shrine when she pulls up the phone and Shinigami kun will be like \"Ugh, those places ick me out. Maybe you should avoid them.\"\n\t\t    * Another Idea:\n\t\t\t    * They give you a little talisman that lets you drive any Shinigami kun out temporarily, as a free gift for every route (discretely, without him knowing). \n\t\t\t    * You can use it on a failed exorcism, but you should save it for the Hiue family(?) (atp i think that's too many moving parts tho)\n    *  Have a vitality meter? \n\t    * Round ends when you run out. After each round you start with less and less of it.\n\t\t    * Make this look vaguely like a candle. But not so much that it's obvious to players. It'll be like a generic energy bar thing\n\t\t\t    * Maybe when it goes down it'll look like melting\n\t\t    * Taking jobs makes it go lower by a set amount.\n\t\t    * Hanging out with Shinigami kun also makes it lower by a set amount (albeit smaller. He *is* a shinigami, after all. Even if he isn't actively killing you)\n\t    * The more jobs you take, the less vitality you have in the next round\n\t\t    * I wonder why...\n\t    * \n* Hiue Family    \n\t* Fatal disease in the balls. I'm joking that it's caused by Shinigami kun but he did really want it to happen.\n    * Shinigami kun wants to go only so he can be the one to do his brother in. \n    * Shinki goes, but then decides to work with Jirou and tricks Shinigami kun- who gets driven away.\n\t    * Idk, maybe if you go bankrupt before the 5th month, you're forced to take the Hiue family job and that leads to the worst ending(?)\n\t\t    * If you're forced to take the Hiue job, then the ending changes depending on when you go bankrupt\n\t\t\t    * 1st week: Worst ending. Shinigami kun blows out the candle for you. Shinigami kun also won't say much about Jirou other than that he hates him.\n\t\t\t    * 2nd week: \n\t\t* \n    * She gets thanked, etc etc, and then when she leaves the building she sees Shinigami kun waiting outside\n    * Gets dragged out to the underworld and sees the candles. See [[The Shinigami that is also a Jellyfish#Endings (most result in you becoming a shinigami)|Endings]]\n- List of rounds: \n\t- Round 1: \n\t\t- Right after Shinki finishes the tutorial. She doesn't have enough money for an apartment so she lives in a net cafe for the time being  \n\t\t- Lowk this is a good time for a general game tutorial since there isn't much to do other than make money (general idea of how the menus work) \n- Numbers by round\n\n| Round |     | Payment* | Available Events                                                                  | Special Items to Buy                                                                                                                                      |\n| ----- | --- | -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1     |     | 5-10k    | <br>- Read Manga<br>- Conbini run<br>- Surf the web<br>- Play in the park<br>     | - New clothes (for Shinigami san): 4.5k<br>   - They make him happier ig<br>- New clothes (for Shinki): 3.5k<br>   - (they give you a 1k boost in profit) |\n| 2     |     | 10-15k   |                                                                                   | - Apartment                                                                                                                                               |\n| 3     |     | 10-17k   | - \"Please give me your customer service smile\"<br>   - Player can choose yes / no |                                                                                                                                                           |\n| 4     |     | 15-20k   |                                                                                   |                                                                                                                                                           |\n| 5     |     | 15-30k   |                                                                                   |                                                                                                                                                           |\n*\\*Anything above the cap will be a guaranteed fail*\n\n### Endings (most result in you dying):\n--- \n* **Love ending**: Maybe kinda yandere? Not sure. \n\t* If you do a certain amount of events. Shinki becomes his raison d'ete, but after the betrayal he decides that he'll just keep her here. Forever.\n* **Candle endings**: Have the candle scene. Hold the candle with the mouse and wait until its lit fully. \n\t* If the player moves the candle before it's //fully// lit, she will die. Shinigami kun will talk while this happens so if the player moves mouse to move along with his dialogue, they die (\"Haha. You think you could light anything with those shakey hands?\"). You just have to hold still and let him talk. (God. This is peak role embodiment tho, You have to ignore him)\n\t\t* Note: Maybe have the candle shake a little by itself and you have to fangangle against it? I like that better lowk\n\t\t* The shinigami will still talk but if you don't fanangle against Shinki's hands while you read then you die\n    * If player lights the candle\n    \t* 1% chance she sneezes and blows it out (get fucked lol) (rolls each time the scene is loaded for the completionists)\n        * Otherwise, Shinigami kun just claps and disappears- ending the interaction and friendship coldly.\n        * Then Shinki goes home as if nothing ever happend...\n        \t* Actually, when Shinki goes to sleep, she sees him by the head of her futon. \"Shit\"\n            * If you didn't buy ofuda (very hard, you need to make a lot of money and fight Shinki on the menuing), the game ends there. Otherwise, you slap the ofuda on him and uh, it gives you enough time to escape. \n            * The win is empty though, and you're back to square one. Now with a shinigami on your heels. Escape the country and change your name.\n","x":-760,"y":-1860,"width":1320,"height":2600},
		{"id":"9e4fd76649f01d32","type":"text","text":"\n# Lore Notes:\n--- \nShinigami kun\n* Prefers his new life as a Shinigami. \n\t* He likes the feeling of being untouchable and having the freedom to do whatever he wants\n* Prized possession is the letter Saburou wrote to him before death. He doesn't have it anymore, but he has at least half of it memorized.\n* Can eat, but only when offered food through people who have a connection with him (can't have him be too ghost-ly now. He must still be bound by the rules of death)\n\t* Could be a good view into what dead people are like in Ite, since we have two ghosts. Nozaki-chan would prolly be able to bend the rules thanks to her lineage tho\n* Super squeamish about copepods, crabs, and the like. Almost pathetically so.\n\n\nShinigami Lore\n* Not psychopomps (?), makes the candle thing kinda obselete\n\t* Though Shinigami nowadays are understood to be grim reapers\n* Cave of candles \n\t* Tbh this part isn't particularly Japanese, since it was imported from a western story. Struggling to incorporate it into the story. I'm thinking it's something specific to the Hiue family tho (like flame rising)\n\t* Maybe it has something to do with the family Kami (jellyfish hero or smth idk. Managed to strike down a turtle all on her lonesome with such speed she caught on ocean fire. Jellyfish Fireball much?)\n\t\t* Pities her descendants and the awful tradition, but feels its necessary because strong jellyfish can't protect shit.\n\t\t\t* Many turn into shinigami or youkai because of it, and she has the ones that can pass on hunt them down so they don't cause harm\n\t\t* Maybe the Hiues as Shinigami are fucking terrifying? Like king of the hill kinda terrifying (nah, continuity issues)\n\t\t\t* (But then why can't he just drive all the shinigami away?)\n\t\t\t\t* Balance thing? \n\t\t\t* What happened to the other Hiues?\n\t\t\t\t* They all passed on, I think. \n\t\t\t* Past hiues definitely can't mess with hiues that are alive. That defeats the whole purpose of the tradition\n* Maybe he died in a way that made him into a shinigami, rather than allowing him to pass on\n\t* tbf i'm sure the other siblings also passed in traumatic ways. \n\t\t* Candle candle candle \n\t* ... bro i'm already back to square one lol. This was the idea before ??? \n\t\t* It just has to be way worse than how his siblings died\n\t\t* Jiro killed him but also tormented him because they had reaaally bad blood.\n\t\t\t* Destroyed his letter in a fire in front of him? \n\t\t\t\t* Incinerated? (Hiues that die this way get a special )\n\t\t\t* Electricity?\n\t\t\t* Firing squad (boring)\n\t\t\t* Lethal injection?\n\t\t\t* Pinned him to the wall with nails and shot/sliced\n\t\t\t* Boiled alive?\n\t\t* Locked/locked in a room and eaten alive by parasites (... 👀). Maybe it's one of Futao's special torture methods that he wanted to test out lowk. Reason why he finds Shinki is because he has vertical migration unlocked\n\t\t\t* Jirou went to such lengths Futao suggested it on a whim. He thinks it's fitting because Shirou fucked around a lot and he has no respect for him.\n\t\t\t* wait holy shit kuru kuru kurikaesu (Shirou learns that they both turn on him, he tries to escape but instead gets lost in the underbelly of the governmental structure)\n\t\t\t\t* The test subjects are like 3 years old atp. I could maybe foreshadow them\n\t\t\t* This is just giving a cruel game of cat and mouse. \n*  ","x":660,"y":-1860,"width":920,"height":1720},
		{"id":"93d762e046b5f08b","type":"text","text":"Inspo Pics","x":-2060,"y":-2440,"width":250,"height":60,"color":"3"},
